<h3><font color="#FFFFFF">What is the WTA?</font></h3>

<p style="line-height: 32px;"><font color="#FFFFFF">The Wisconsin Traditional Archers, or WTA, is the state traditional archery group.&nbsp; We work with traditional archery promoting clubs throughout the state as well as other states. OUR MISSION...is to promote responsible and ethical bow hunting practices, support other archery organizations that do the same, bring together those interested in traditional archery equipment and skills, and to ensure the continuation of the traditions and skills passed down by our traditional forefathers.</font></p></div>
